  "translation": "Na i kamap, taim ol i krosim pinis, Eliyahu i tok long Elisa: Askim wanem bai mi mekim bilong yu, pastaim long ol i kisim mi i go long yu. Na Elisa i tok: Plis, i kamap olsem tupela hap bilong maus bilong ruak bilong yu long mi.",
